{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10534","headline":"同郭十题杨主簿新厅 · 高适","name":"同郭十题杨主簿新厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华馆曙沈沈，惟良正在今。\n用材兼柱石，闻物象高深。\n更得芝兰地，兼营枳棘林。\n向风扃戟户，当署近棠阴。\n勿改安卑节，聊闲理剧心。\n多君有知己，一和郢中吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}